// expect-stdout: there is no sequence at `nothing` to insert into at $.nothing
// expect-stdout: the sequence has 5 items: insert takes an index from 0 to 5 at $.steps
// expect-stdout: there is no sequence at `block` to insert into at $.block
// expect-stdout: a document keeps its root: set it instead at $
// expect-stdout: there is no value at `missing` in the text to remove at $.missing
